OL,3,GNEWSAPlaque placed at home of Liverpool
OL,4,Alegend Paisley
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plaque has been unveiled at the
OL,7,Fformer home of Liverpool Football
OL,8,FClub's most successful manager Bob
OL,9,FPaisley.
OL,11,FHe took over in 1974 after Bill
OL,12,FShankly's shock resignation and in his
OL,13,Fnine seasons in charge, Paisley won six
OL,14,Fleague titles, three European Cups,
OL,15,Fthree League Cups, a Uefa Cup, Super
OL,16,FCup and three Charity Shields. He was
OL,17,Falso manager of the year on six
OL,18,Foccasions.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
