OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPlaque placed at home of Liverpool
OL,4,Alegend Paisley
OL,5,
OL,6,FOriginally from Hetton-le-Hole on the
OL,7,Foutskirts of Sunderland, Bob Paisley
OL,8,Fspent 45 years at Liverpool as a
OL,9,Fplayer, physiotherapist, coach,
OL,10,Fassistant manager, manager and
OL,11,Fdirector.
OL,13,FHe lived for many years in the
OL,14,FLiverpool suburb of Woolton where today
OL,15,Fa plaque was unveiled at his former
OL,16,Fhome on Bower Road.
